{
  "part": "ch02",
  "id": "lines-and-arrows",
  "title": "线与箭头",
  "partTitle": "基础图形",
  "prev": {
    "part": "ch02",
    "id": "basic-shapes",
    "title": "基本形状",
    "path": "/ch/ch02/basic-shapes"
  },
  "next": {
    "part": "ch02",
    "id": "arcs-and-curves",
    "title": "圆弧与曲线",
    "path": "/ch/ch02/arcs-and-curves"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>本节覆盖线段、虚线、各类箭头与角度标记。它们的共同点是：都构建在 <code>TipableVMobject</code> 机制之上，因此线段和圆弧都能“长”出箭头。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Arrow",
        "Line",
        "TipableVMobject",
        "VMobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Line",
      "text": "Line"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Line</code> 是连接 <code>start</code> 与 <code>end</code> 两点的线段（默认从 <code>LEFT</code> 到 <code>RIGHT</code>），是所有线类图形的基类。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>start</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike \\",
          "default": "Mobject",
          "desc": "[-1, 0, 0]"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>end</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike \\",
          "default": "Mobject",
          "desc": "[1, 0, 0]"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "两端向内收缩的长度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>path_arc</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "弯曲程度（弧度）；大于 0 时线段变成弧线"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">line = Line(LEFT, RIGHT, color=BLUE)\nline = Line(circle, square)  # 两端自动吸附到两个 mobject 的中心\n</code></pre>\n<p>常见坑：<code>buff</code> 会让线段两端<strong>同时</strong>缩短；<code>path_arc</code> 是弧度而不是角度，画弯曲连线时常配合 <code>.animate</code> 或 <code>path_arc=PI/4</code> 使用。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "DashedLine",
      "text": "DashedLine"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>虚线段，<code>DashedLine</code> 直接继承 <code>Line</code>，所有 <code>Line</code> 参数都可用，额外控制虚线的颗粒度。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>dash_length</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.05",
          "desc": "每段虚线的长度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>dashed_ratio</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.5",
          "desc": "虚线段与间隔的比例；0 到 1 之间"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>dash_length</code> 是相对 Manim 单位的长度；线条很长而 <code>dash_length</code> 不变时会显得“密”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Arrow",
      "text": "Arrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>带箭头的线段，最常用的指示工具。<code>Arrow</code> 继承 <code>Line</code>，自动在线的终点添加一个箭头尖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "6",
          "desc": "线身描边宽度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.25",
          "desc": "箭身两端收缩量，使箭头不贴着端点"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>max_tip_length_to_length_ratio</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.25",
          "desc": "箭头最大长度与线长的比例（限制箭头不过大）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>max_stroke_width_to_length_ratio</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "5",
          "desc": "箭头最大宽度与线长比例"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>额外的关键字参数（来自 <code>TipableVMobject</code> 机制）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>tip_shape</code> —— 箭头尖形状类，如 <code>tip_shape=StealthTip</code></li>\n<li><code>tip_style</code> —— 传给箭头尖构造器的样式字典，如 <code>tip_style={\"fill_opacity\": 0.5}</code></li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/lines_arrows_demo",
      "scene": "LinesArrowsDemo",
      "caption": "<p><code>Line</code> / <code>DashedLine</code> / <code>Arrow</code> / <code>DoubleArrow</code> / <code>Vector</code> 同台：注意 <code>Arrow</code> 默认 <code>buff=0.25</code>，箭身与端点之间留有缝隙；<code>tip_shape=StealthTip</code> 换成隐形战机风格的细长箭头。</p>",
      "code": "\"\"\"LinesArrowsDemo: Line / DashedLine / Arrow / DoubleArrow / Vector.\"\"\"\n\nfrom manim import *\n\n\nclass LinesArrowsDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        line = Line(LEFT * 5 + DOWN, LEFT * 3 + UP, color=BLUE)\n        dashed = DashedLine(LEFT * 2.5 + UP * 2, RIGHT * 2.5 + UP * 2, dash_length=0.2)\n\n        arrow = Arrow(LEFT * 4, LEFT * 4 + 2 * UP + RIGHT, buff=0, color=GREEN)\n        stealth = Arrow(\n            LEFT * 1.5 + DOWN * 2,\n            RIGHT * 1.5 + DOWN * 0.5,\n            buff=0,\n            tip_shape=StealthTip,\n            color=YELLOW,\n        )\n        double = DoubleArrow(RIGHT * 2 + DOWN * 2, RIGHT * 5 + DOWN * 0.5, buff=0, color=RED)\n\n        vector = Vector(RIGHT * 1.5 + UP, color=MAROON).shift(LEFT * 0.5 + UP * 0.5)\n\n        self.play(Create(line), Create(dashed))\n        self.play(GrowArrow(arrow), GrowArrow(stealth), GrowArrow(double))\n        self.play(GrowArrow(vector))\n        self.wait(1)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：v0.21.0 中 <code>Arrow</code> 的默认箭头尖是 <code>ArrowTriangleFilledTip</code>（实心三角），不是旧资料里常见的空心三角；箭头尖不会自动随 <code>buff</code> 缩放，短箭头配大 <code>buff</code> 会显得很挤。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "DoubleArrow",
      "text": "DoubleArrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>两端都有箭头尖的线，继承 <code>Arrow</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>tip_shape_start</code>",
          "type": "type[ArrowTip]",
          "default": "ArrowTriangleFilledTip",
          "desc": "起点处箭头尖形状"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>tip_shape_end</code>",
          "type": "type[ArrowTip]",
          "default": "ArrowTriangleFilledTip",
          "desc": "终点处箭头尖形状"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">DoubleArrow(LEFT, RIGHT, tip_shape_start=ArrowCircleFilledTip)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Vector",
      "text": "Vector"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>从原点出发指向给定方向的箭头，继承 <code>Arrow</code>，常用于表示向量。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>direction</code>",
          "type": "Vector2DLike \\",
          "default": "Vector3DLike",
          "desc": "[1, 0, 0]"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "两端收缩量，默认不收缩"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">Vector([1, 2])          # 指向 (1, 2) 的向量\nVector(OUT)             # 指向屏幕外的 3D 向量\n</code></pre>\n<p>常见坑：<code>Vector</code> 的构造参数是<strong>方向向量</strong>而不是终点坐标，起点固定在 <code>ORIGIN</code>；想要任意起点的向量请用 <code>Arrow(start, end)</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Angle",
      "text": "Angle"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Angle</code> 在两条直线的交点处画出夹角弧线，可附带圆点、直角符号，并能读取角度值。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>line1</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第一条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>line2</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第二条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>radius</code>",
          "type": "float \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>quadrant</code>",
          "type": "AngleQuadrant",
          "default": "(1, 1)",
          "desc": "弧线所在的象限，如 (-1, 1)"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>other_angle</code>",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "False",
          "desc": "True 时画反角（优角）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>dot</code>",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "False",
          "desc": "是否在弧线中点加圆点"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>dot_radius</code>",
          "type": "float \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>dot_distance</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.55",
          "desc": "圆点距交点的比例位置"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>dot_color</code>",
          "type": "ParsableManimColor",
          "default": "WHITE",
          "desc": "圆点颜色"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>elbow</code>",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "False",
          "desc": "True 时用直角折线代替弧线"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">angle = Angle(line1, line2, radius=0.6, dot=True)\nangle.get_value()            # 弧度\nangle.get_value(degrees=True)  # 角度\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/angle_marks",
      "scene": "AngleMarks",
      "caption": "<p><code>Angle</code> 带圆点并配合 <code>get_value(degrees=True)</code> 标注度数；<code>RightAngle</code> 画直角方块；<code>TangentLine</code> 在圆上 1/4 弧长处作切线。</p>",
      "code": "\"\"\"AngleMarks: Angle / RightAngle / Elbow / TangentLine / TangentialArc.\"\"\"\n\nfrom manim import *\n\n\nclass AngleMarks(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        line1 = Line(ORIGIN, RIGHT * 2)\n        line2 = Line(ORIGIN, UP * 1.5 + RIGHT)\n        angle = Angle(line1, line2, radius=0.6, dot=True, dot_color=RED)\n        value = Angle(line1, line2, radius=0.45).get_value(degrees=True)\n        label = Text(f\"{value:.0f}°\", font_size=30).move_to(\n            Angle(line1, line2, radius=0.9).point_from_proportion(0.5)\n        )\n\n        hline = Line(LEFT * 5 + UP * 2, LEFT * 3 + UP * 2)\n        vline = Line(LEFT * 4 + UP * 2, LEFT * 4 + UP * 0.5)\n        right_angle = RightAngle(hline, vline, length=0.35)\n\n        circle = Circle(radius=1.2).shift(RIGHT * 3.5 + DOWN * 1.5)\n        tangent = TangentLine(circle, alpha=0.25, length=2, color=YELLOW)\n\n        self.play(Create(line1), Create(line2))\n        self.play(Create(angle), Write(label))\n        self.play(Create(hline), Create(vline), Create(right_angle))\n        self.play(Create(circle), Create(tangent))\n        self.wait(1)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "version",
      "title": "版本说明",
      "html": "<p>在 v0.21.0 中，当两条直线<strong>平行或共线</strong>（无唯一交点）时，<code>Angle</code> 不再抛出 <code>ValueError</code>，而是退化为一个空 Mobject（<code>angle_value</code> 记为 0）。旧代码若依赖“平行线报错”的分支需要调整。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>quadrant</code> 的取值是 <code>(±1, ±1)</code> 四种组合，分别对应交点四周的四个角域；默认 <code>(1, 1)</code> 画的是两线正方向之间的角。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "RightAngle",
      "text": "RightAngle"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>直角的快捷写法：本质是 <code>Angle(line1, line2, radius=length, elbow=True)</code>，在交点画一个直角小方块。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>line1</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第一条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>line2</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第二条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>length</code>",
          "type": "float \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Elbow",
      "text": "Elbow"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Elbow</code> 是一个独立的直角折角图形（两段等宽短边），继承 <code>VMobject</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.2",
          "desc": "折角两段的宽度（边长）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>angle</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "整体旋转角度（弧度）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>Elbow</code> 的角点默认在其包围盒中心附近，需要精确定位时配合 <code>move_to</code> / <code>shift</code> 调整。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "TangentLine",
      "text": "TangentLine"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>TangentLine</code> 在任意 <code>VMobject</code> 路径的指定位置作切线段，继承 <code>Line</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>vmob</code>",
          "type": "VMobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "目标图形（圆、曲线等）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>alpha</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "路径上的相对位置，0 到 1"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>length</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "1",
          "desc": "切线段长度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>d_alpha</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "1e-06",
          "desc": "求导时使用的微小增量"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>alpha</code> 是<strong>归一化弧长比例</strong>而不是角度；对闭合图形 0 和 1 都指向起点。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "TangentialArc",
      "text": "TangentialArc"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>TangentialArc</code> 过“切点”画一段与两条线都相切的圆弧，常用于表现圆角过渡；继承 <code>ArcBetweenPoints</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>line1</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第一条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>line2</code>",
          "type": "Line",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "第二条线"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>radius</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "圆弧半径（圆角大小）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>corner</code>",
          "type": "tuple[float, float]",
          "default": "(1, 1)",
          "desc": "取两线哪一侧的夹角"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>radius</code> 太大、超过两线交点附近可容纳的范围时，切点会落到线段之外，图形看起来“脱节”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "tipablevmobject",
      "text": "TipableVMobject"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>TipableVMobject</code> 是“可挂箭头尖”的 mixin 基类：<code>Line</code> 与 <code>Arc</code> 都继承它，因此直线和圆弧都能添加箭头尖（<code>CurvedArrow</code> 正是这样实现的）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>tip_length</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.35",
          "desc": "箭头尖默认长度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>normal_vector</code>",
          "type": "Vector3DLike",
          "default": "[0, 0, 1]",
          "desc": "箭头尖朝向的法向量"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>tip_style</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常用方法：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">obj.add_tip()                                   # 终点加默认箭头尖\nobj.add_tip(tip_shape=ArrowCircleTip)           # 指定形状\nobj.add_tip(at_start=True)                      # 起点加箭头尖\nobj.get_tip()                                   # 取终点箭头尖（可能为 None）\n</code></pre>\n<p>常见坑：<code>add_tip()</code> 返回的是 mobject 自身（链式调用安全），但箭头尖是<strong>子 mobject</strong>，<code>remove</code> 它请用 <code>obj.remove(obj.get_tip())</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "ArrowTip",
      "text": "ArrowTip"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>所有箭头尖的抽象基类，定义了箭头尖与线身衔接的接口（<code>base</code>、<code>tip_point</code>、<code>get_length</code> 等）。一般不直接实例化，而是通过 <code>tip_shape=</code> 传给 <code>Arrow</code>/<code>add_tip()</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "ArrowTip",
        "VMobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "ArrowTriangleTip",
      "text": "ArrowTriangleTip"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>空心三角形箭头尖（默认描边、不填充），继承 <code>ArrowTip</code> 与 <code>Triangle</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>fill_opacity</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "填充不透明度（0 即空心）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "3",
          "desc": "描边宽度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>length</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.35",
          "desc": "箭头尖长度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.35",
          "desc": "箭头尖宽度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>start_angle</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "PI",
          "desc": "箭头尖自身旋转角"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
